Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs11\pos(191.2,161.067)\fnGeorgia}Maomao's Diaries
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.30,0:00:37.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H6F9B3F&\pos(219.6,32)}Time for Maomao's Trivia!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.38,0:00:37.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs10\c&H142041&\pos(220.533,66.133)\2c&HE8F3F5&\3c&HF5F5F5&\4c&HE5F3F8&}Ergot
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.18,0:00:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(186.72,284.16)}Fun fact about ergot: it is a type of fungus that mainly infects rice and wheat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.91,0:00:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,, It is dark in color and elongated in shape, resembling a horn, which is how it got its name.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.18,0:00:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It has sometimes been used in medications to control postpartum bleeding, \Nbut even small amounts can cause blood vessel constriction and may lead to gangrene in the feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.20,0:00:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It can also cause hallucinogenic effects. \NIt must be handled with the utmost care.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.40,0:00:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Something smells fishy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.00,0:00:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Who on earth is walking around handing out those flyers?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.25,0:00:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What's their goal?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.56,0:00:50.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's the first-timer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.56,0:00:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Basen-sama, what brings you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.84,0:00:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.51,0:00:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems I left something behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.28,0:01:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.88,0:01:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no one else around, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.72,0:01:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Rest assured, Pairin-neesan went out to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.20,0:01:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Neesan? Is that woman your older sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.69,0:01:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What a pain...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.40,0:01:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,No, the one who was entertaining you just a moment ago is... one of the top-class beauties of this establishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.58,0:01:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,There are customers who visit just to catch a glimpse of her, so even just being able to see her face is a huge deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.76,0:01:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I-Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.30,0:01:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I ended up being quite rude to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.96,0:01:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're interested, shall I put in a good word with Yarite Baba?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.32,0:01:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,N-No, thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.48,0:01:42.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Rest assured, even Pairin-neesan wouldn't just devour you on the spot—
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.16,0:01:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,...No, she'd definitely devour you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.16,0:01:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Does that woman eat men?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.19,0:01:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done here! \NI'm going home!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.03,0:01:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you don't need what you left behind?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.69,0:02:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\2c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H767679&\4c&HC6C6D0&\pos(192,173.6)}To be continued
